Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.13,Chinese,C06-09-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}这些检查已经整理成知识专题，原生数据读取的方法也可以复用。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:06.13,English,C06-09-S01,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}These checks are now recorded in knowledge documents,\Nand the native data-reading methods can be reused.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:14.43,Chinese,C06-09-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}换机器或存档，可以沿用方法；版本、人物、军队和眼前读数仍要重新确认。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.76,0:00:14.43,English,C06-09-S02,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1008)}Use the method on another machine or save, but confirm the version,\Ncharacter, army, and current readings afresh.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:18.66,Chinese,C06-09-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}缺少的信息就保持未知，不靠猜补齐。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.06,0:00:18.66,English,C06-09-S03,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}Missing information stays unknown instead of being guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:22.83,Chinese,C06-09-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,935)}离线文件检查，也不能当作新的游戏结果。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.26,0:00:22.83,English,C06-09-S04,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,1030)}An offline file check is not a new game result.
